{"id":"d1273db74b820a37","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-set9-rank-bounded-family.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Rank Bounded Family","display":"df-zfc-set9-rank-bounded-family — ZFC Set9 Rank Bounded Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-rank-bounded-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-rank-bounded-family"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-rank-bounded-family — ZFC Set9 Rank Bounded Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[58-df-v-alpha]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-rank-bounded-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-rank-bounded-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-rank-bounded-family — ZFC Set9 Rank Bounded Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"58-df-v-alpha\">58-df-v-alpha</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (family of sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> (cumulative-hierarchy stage, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"58-df-v-alpha\">58-df-v-alpha</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9RankBoundedFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9RankBoundedFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}rank\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}family}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet9RankBoundedFamily}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land A\\subseteq V_\\alpha\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}rank\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}family}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet9RankBoundedFamily}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land A\\subseteq V_\\alpha\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rank-boundedness is expressed through one set-sized cumulative stage, avoiding a definable proper-class graph as an object-language argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-v-alpha","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","locat